# What the Vercel CLI may NOT upload from the repo root.
#
# The project's Root Directory is `frontend`, but `vercel` uploads the whole
# working directory before building — so without this file a deploy both fails
# and over-shares:
#
#   - .validator/admin.rpc is a live Solana test-validator socket; the uploader
#     cannot read a FIFO and the deploy dies with "Unknown system error -102".
#   - keys/, wallets/, .demo-config.json and .demo-faucet.json hold SECRET KEYS.
#     Nothing in the browser bundle needs them and they must never leave the box.
#
# The frontend has no workspace dependencies (all deps are npm), so everything
# outside frontend/ can go.

# --- secrets: never upload ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
keys/
wallets/
.demo-config.json
.demo-config.json.bak-*
.demo-faucet.json
.demo-faucet.json.bak-*
*.keypair.json
.keeper*.json
.mm-status.json

# --- local validator state (contains sockets/FIFOs the uploader cannot read) ---
.validator*/
.pyth-validator/

# --- build output and local state ---
target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
logs/
*.log

# --- backend + tooling the browser bundle never imports ---
services/
programs/
packages/
scripts/
tests/
fixtures/
docs/
design_mockups/
.claude/
.cursor/
memory-bank/
Cargo.lock
Cargo.toml
Anchor.toml
Dockerfile
Makefile
*.md
